comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T11:45:48.529Z",codex-agent,"Implements companion specification pm-cli-website-2glk (read only). One native owner holds reduction state, trial journal and durable operation identities. Caller executes the oracle. Scaffold is isolated on main; implementation is on feat/reduce. No external publication is authorized."
  "2026-11-06T12:36:27.459Z",codex-agent,"Preflight evidence: full suite passed 35/35 with complete production instrumentation at 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines; later focused checks cover strengthened host capability and certificate validation. Packed npm/Bun, npx/bunx, Git-absent transports and SDK imports passed the captured-artifact rehearsal. Final committed candidate will run both full release checks sequentially with unchanged thresholds. SDK transport limitation is isolated in reduce-sdk-transport; package fallback flags satisfy the delivered contract."
  "2026-11-06T13:14:07.591Z",codex-agent,"Read-only overlap audit confirms boundaries: pm-evidence owns citation freshness and source support; pm-hypothesis owns explanation admission and discriminating observations; pm-http owns declared HTTP requests and response observations. Reduction search, durable trial intent/outcomes and qualified deletion certificates remain pm-reduce-owned. No source package, task status or assurance verdict is modified by domain commands."
  "2026-11-06T14:09:45.682Z",codex-agent,"Orchestrator published the existing candidate as unbraind/pm-reduce PR 1 at b34b0c4. Owning the review loop and CI closeout without merging. Queued CodeRabbit immediately through the shared queue, before CI completion. Existing implementation and local gates are preserved; new changes will be driven by validated review findings or CI failures."
  "2026-11-06T15:39:47.440Z",codex-agent,"Review handoff for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-reduce/pull/1: one queued review attempt, zero completed review rounds, zero findings, zero fix pushes, and all required CI green on b34b0c4d4d446fb07b07c1ea6c13b1efedbdef00. The bounded 90-minute wait expired before the shared queue reached this PR. Review evidence remains an open risk; skipped notices and zero threads are not approval. No merge or release was performed. Review-phase tracker records are committed locally and held for the next substantive fix push, as instructed; no separate metadata push. Existing later-scope and SDK-transport Features remain open; release implementation and previously recorded gates are unchanged."
